==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} ''[[bleh]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɛç|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Blechs|gen2=Bleches|Bleche}}

# [[sheet]] (out of metal)
# {{informal|music|lang=de}} [[brass|Brass]], a collective term for all brass instruments, or all brass players, etc.
: ''„Das '''Blech''' spielt bitte mal alleine!“ rief der Dirigent.''
: The conductor demanded loudly: “Brass play on their own now, please!”

